        <mxCell id="rules" value="KEY RULES&#10;FMRC request review comes before payment availability; approval reserves stock and is separate from starting preparation.&#10;New normal orders support enabled online payment or cash on pickup. Delivery uses the eligible online-payment path.&#10;Online payment: F14. Cash pickup and collection: F15. Delivery: F16. Legacy COD is not a new-order default." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#273142;fontFamily=Montserrat;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
